  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bernardii-folk have a long history of being skilled magical craftsmen, with their large forms and thick fur aiding in their work by resisting the cold climes of their homelands or providing natural padding against the heat of the forge. You treat the severity of environmental temperature as one step milder. You also become Trained in Crafting and gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.xWY5omyIcILNR7y1]{Magical Crafting} feat, even if you don’t meet its prerequisites.</span></p>"
